WEBVTT

00:00:00.533 --> 00:00:03.967
Scanned on a night shift,
but your supervisor works days?

00:00:04.733 --> 00:00:07.033
With Wavelength,
you log the scan while it's fresh,

00:00:08.933 --> 00:00:11.333
send a review request to
a verified supervisor,

00:00:12.933 --> 00:00:14.767
and they review it when
they're next available.

00:00:17.733 --> 00:00:21.833
Your scans, your reviews and
your progress, all in one place,

00:00:21.833 --> 00:00:23.733
and it costs nothing to use.

00:00:25.433 --> 00:00:27.233
Start your free logbook today.
